      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the cost of packers and movers from Bangalore to Thalassery compare with other intercity routes?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The fare is primarily distance‑based, with additional charges for weight, volume, and special services. Our transparent cost matrix shows competitive pricing, often lower than generic movers because we use owned specialized trucks and optimized highway corridors, reducing fuel and toll expenses.</p>
